  "title": "Onion Sauce",
  "description": "Onions are caramelized and blended with paprika and rye bread in this delicious sauce. When we were little my Oma would serve this sauce over either pork or beef.",
  "authors": [
    "LINDA MCLEAN"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-06-18T23:12:48-04:00",
